ts, mysterious locations, eerie sounds, and exciting gameplay designed to test your skills. Whether you're exploring during the day or entering the horror experience, there will always be something new to discover.\n\nThe game is actively being updated with new maps, cosmetics, features, quality improvements, and future content. More surprises are planned, so keep playing and check back for every new update as the adventure continues to grow.", "short_description": "Swing, climb, and jump through immersive VR worlds using realistic gorilla locomotion. Move with your own arms, and master your movement skills in a fun and exciting adventure. Enjoy smooth controls, challenging environments, and regular updates with new horror mod coming soon!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacy-cola/accueil", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "tmr_Fangame", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/cola-tagg/accueil", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1189913680880847"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1364452282539512"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1364452282539512"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786984320, "status": "PUBLISHED"